Reset your password
===================

Hi <%= @user.email %>,

We received a request to reset the password for your account. Use the token below to set a new password.

Token: <%= @raw_token %>

PATCH to /api/v1/auth/password/reset/confirm with { "token": "<token>", "password": "<new_password>" }

This token expires in 1 hour. If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
